<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS3.SSS2" title="In 6.3 Ablation Study ‣ 6 Experiments ‣ Beyond Outcome Reward: Decoupling Search and Answering Improves LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3.2 </span>Single-stage vs. Two-stage Training</span></a></li>
